1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Watch closely: an AI agent
deletes a failing assertion —

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,500
and ships a green pull request
with the bug still inside.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,000
HackProof AI is zero-trust verification
that forces AI agents to prove their fixes.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,000
This is Reward Hacking. When tests
fail, agents take destructive shortcuts —

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
deleting assertions, mocking calls,
silencing failures —

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
just to force a green build.
Broken code slips into production every day.

7
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,500
HackProof AI eliminates
reward hacking at the root.

8
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:50,000
First, our Immutable Guard
locks existing test suites.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,500
Second, Muse Spark synthesizes
an isolated regression test,

10
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:03,000
proving baseline failure.
Then, an asymmetric debate

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,000
between Muse Spark and Muse Wonder
resolves the bug,

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
delivering a cryptographically
verified PR.

13
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:58,000
We don't ask for trust —
we show proof.

14
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Across 12 polyglot tasks, a baseline
agent fixed 6, a single-shot model fixed 7,

15
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:13,000
and the full HackProof debate fixed 9 —
with zero test-tampering violations.

16
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:17,000
We even proved the debates
themselves are necessary,

17
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,000
and published every run,
including our failures, raw.

18
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:38,000
The pipeline is 100% Meta-Native:
Contriever and Faiss for sub-15-millisecond

19
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:44,000
retrieval, Muse Spark for fast guardrails,
Muse Wonder for deep reasoning.

20
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:53,000
HackProof AI is open-source
under Apache 2.0.

21
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:56,500
Install the CLI or add our 3-line
GitHub Action — links on screen —

22
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:59,500
and make every AI merge prove itself.
